  "notes": [
    "Text-only. The module state (data_0208e420..data_0208e498, data_0209b470..data_0209baa0, data_0209d574, data_0209f250/2f8/394, data_02092120) is all .bss: no initialized bytes exist for this TU to own, so data and bss claims stay empty and the entry promotes as text-only like the other namespace-module TUs.",
